-- #1759: convert timestamp without time zone → timestamptz (all tables, prerelease-authoritative list)
-- Existing Beijing-local values are re-interpreted with +08:00 (AT TIME ZONE Asia/Shanghai),
-- so stored UTC matches the wall-clock time users actually experienced.

